> The American Society of Hematology (ASH) will recognize Marshall A. Lichtman, MD, of the University of Rochester School of Medicine and Dentistry, with the 2017 Wallace H. Coulter Award for[ Lifetime] Achievement in Hematology. Dr. Lichtman will be honored for his notable service to the field of he[mat]ology as an educator,[ mentor], researcher, and physician throughout his 51-year career.
